          <div class="question"><b>Q2. What does setInterval do?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="a"> Runs AGAIN and AGAIN after every delay</label><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="b"> Runs once only</label><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="c"> Runs at once</label><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="d"> Never runs</label></div>
